              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Otarireeba ente nari entaama ya mwene waanyu neebura, okagyehuzya; buzimazima oryagigarurayo owa mwene waanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mwene waanyu ku ariba akuri hare, nari ku oriba otarikumumanya, oryagitaasya omuka, ogume nayo, okuhitsya obu mwene waanyu arigisherura; bwanyima okagimugarurira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n'endogoya ye oryagitwaza otyo, n'ekijwaro kye okitwaze otyo, kandi otwaze otyo n'ekindi kintu kyona ekya mwene waanyu, ekiriba kibuzire okakibona; otaribyehuzya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otarireeba endogoya ya mwene waanyu nari ente ye egwire aha muhanda, okagyehuzya; otaribura kumuhwera kugiimutsya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
