        {
          "text": " Omushaija ku arishangwa naashambana na muka omushaija, bombi baryaitwa, omushaija owaaba abyami n'omukazi, kandi n'ogwo mukazi; ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekyo kibi omuri Israeli.",
