          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogwo mushaija obyamire nawe aryariha ishe w'omwishiki shekeli z'efeeza makumi ataano, bwanyima abe omukazi we, ahabw'okuba amusiisire; kandi atarimushenda ebiro byona ebi ariba akiriho.",
          "type": "text",
